    "innovation": "This paper provides a comprehensive and consistent assessment of global transport emissions, revealing that non-CO2 pollutants cause a substantial cooling effect that significantly offsets the warming from CO2 under both present-day and future scenarios, highlighting a critical trade-off for climate protection strategies.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
